# OfficeLabs patch registry — every upstream LibreOffice file this fork modifies or deletes.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
# The 2026-02 upstream refresh cost weeks, not because merging was hard, but because
# nobody could say what "ours" was: the fork is a full LibreOffice tree with our commits
# merged into upstream history, so "what did we change" was a research project every time.
# This file is that answer, checked in and enforced. `./upstream-sync.sh registry` fails
# a PR that patches an upstream file not listed here, so the list cannot silently rot.
#
# NOT LISTED HERE, ON PURPOSE:
#   officelabs/**        our own module, added wholesale — it can never conflict.
#                        Source of truth is officelabs-core; see CLAUDE.md.
#   *.png *.ico *.icns *.svg   branding binaries. Always resolve "ours"; never a text conflict.
#   files we ADD under an upstream directory (distro-configs/OfficeLabs*.conf,
#                        include/vcl/officelabs/, sfx2/inc/sidebar/OfficelabsTheme.hxx, …)
#                        — an added file has no upstream side to conflict with.
#
# base: e8c17d8aec8e103d5353cd83d3d08323510ac83a   (upstream commit this fork last merged,
#        2026-02-22, upstream master. Update it when a refresh lands. Used by
#        `registry` when no upstream ref has been fetched — e.g. in CI.)
#
# Format: one path per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
# Regenerate with: ./upstream-sync.sh registry --write

## --- Deleted upstream content ------------------------------------------------
# Submodules and helpers we do not ship. Every upstream refresh re-raises these as
# modify/delete conflicts; the resolution is always "keep ours" (stay deleted).
dictionaries
helpcontent2
translations
g
.gitmodules

## --- Build configuration ------------------------------------------------------
# OfficeLabs identity, the CEF/officelabs module registration, and Windows/macOS
# toolchain fixes. configure.ac + Repository*.mk are where the officelabs module
# enters the build; expect small, mechanical conflicts here on every refresh.
.gitattributes
.gitignore
Repository.mk
RepositoryExternal.mk
RepositoryModule_host.mk
config_host.mk.in
configure.ac
sanitize-ubsan-excludelist
solenv/bin/modules/installer/simplepackage.pm
solenv/bin/ooinstall
solenv/gbuild/Gallery.mk
solenv/gcc-wrappers/wrapper.cxx

## --- Third-party build fixes ---------------------------------------------------
# Local workarounds for building externals under our toolchain. HIGHEST CHURN AREA:
# upstream rewrites these freely and our one-line edits conflict often. When one
# conflicts, prefer upstream wholesale and re-test — do not hand-merge a workaround
# that upstream may already have fixed.
external/boost/UnpackedTarball_boost.mk
external/fast_float/UnpackedTarball_fast_float.mk
external/frozen/UnpackedTarball_frozen.mk
external/glm/UnpackedTarball_glm.mk
