## --- Sidebar / AI deck integration ---------------------------------------------
# THE LOAD-BEARING PATCH SET. This is what makes the OfficeLabs deck exist, theme
# itself, and stay the active panel. Upstream refactors sfx2/source/sidebar/ most
# releases, so these are the conflicts that need a human who knows the feature.
# A refresh that resolves these by "take upstream" silently removes the product.
